  bx('bl', "<b>Political angle:</b> British backed the <b>Aryan Invasion Theory</b> (India's greatness brought by migrant Europeans); <b>kinship argument</b>: 'we are not foreigners, we are cousins come home' = rhetoric of love hiding exploitation. Handout figure names: Colebrooke, Wilson, Prinsep (Brahmi), <b>ASI 1861</b> by Alexander Cunningham; learn lightly."),
