  t("<b>Utilitarianism</b>", "<b>Jeremy Bentham, James Mill</b> (list also JS Mill): not culture change but good policy and strong rule of law; laws for the greatest number", "<b>James Mill's History of British India (1818)</b>: India's great past a <b>myth</b>; needs an <b>effective schoolmaster</b> imposing governance from above", "Mill joined the <b>Court of Directors</b>, pushed the <b>Law Commission 1834</b> under Macaulay", "<b>Inherent authoritarian streak</b>", w=22),
